  "merge_notes": [
    "Patches are reference handoffs, not applied to public Source. Local workspace already contains the complete implementation; do not reapply there.",
    "ForgingSystem includes the unpublished CraftingSystem.h for FColdSteelCraftingInput; restore that shared interface without publishing unrelated workbench changes.",
    "ProcessedDamage and tooltip formula hunks isolate Forge multiplication against the public baseline. Merge with current melee/tool multipliers without applying Forge twice; local full source uses the combined formula.",
    "Local dungeon input-release PlayerTick additionally gates !ColdSteelHUD->IsWorldForging(). That mixed dungeon block is excluded; preserve the guard when integrating the existing dungeon handoff.",
    "forge-grip.json contains licensed donor/native pose data and stays local. Restore together with accepted V7 arms and editable Blender donors.",
    "Casting station prefab palette and all uasset dependencies remain local. Use the documented author/install chain and source manifests.",
    "After this snapshot, ColdSteelForgingWidget.h/.cpp gained a parallel product-preview split. Those later changes and forging-product-split-plan-20260927.md are intentionally excluded; workspace versions are preserved. This handoff keeps the completed material-column snapshot."
  ],
